### Cell 14 (markdown)

## What to look for

| Metric | Why it matters |
|--------|---------------|
| **JSON Success Rate** | Must be 100% for production. If a model fails to return valid JSON, it's unusable. |
| **Quality Score** | Weighted accuracy across all fields. Higher = better extraction. |
| **No Hallucination** | Certs showing up in skills = hallucination. Must be 100%. |
| **Tokens/sec** | Speed indicator. Higher = faster inference on same hardware. |
| **Time** | End-to-end latency. Lower = better user experience. |

### Decision guide
- If Qwen wins on quality AND JSON reliability → switch to Qwen for local deployment
- If tied on quality → pick whichever is faster (lower hardware requirement)
- If Llama wins → stay with Llama (already battle-tested in your production pipeline)

